Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.00,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Melempar GUNUNG itu disebut strategi?!"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.00,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.70,S_id,,0,0,0,,Strategiku berhasil!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Benar-benar strategi gila.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu pakai kekuatan kasar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.90,S_id,,0,0,0,,angkat gunung tumbangkan orang disebut strategi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Apa hubungannya dengan strategi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:10.76,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tarik pasukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:11.76,S_id,,0,0,0,,Hadiah terkirim:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.44,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan +1, tuan rumah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:15.54,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sistem sialan, belum selesai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.58,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu sistem ahli strategi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.58,S_id,,0,0,0,,atau sistem otot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.92,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tambah kecerdasan dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.36,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana, Tuan Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.30,S_id,,0,0,0,,Lapor, Yang Mulia:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:23.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,misi berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.64,S_id,,0,0,0,,Strategiku sukses lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.58,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.56,S_id,,0,0,0,,Selamat atas pencapaian besar, Tuan Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ambil hadiahmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.76,S_id,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, Yang Mulia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.12,S_id,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tuan Li mendaki dengan tangan kosong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,memecahkan punggung bukit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.56,S_id,,0,0,0,,mencabut gunung tiga puluh meter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:36.78,S_id,,0,0,0,,dan menghancurkan musuh beserta armornya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:38.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Itu disebut strategi berhasil?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.46,S_id,,0,0,0,,Saudara Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.66,S_id,,0,0,0,,Benar-benar jenius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:41.98,S_id,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa!
